---
import LegalPage from '../../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { club, formEndpoint } from '../../data/site';
import { route } from '../../i18n';
---

<LegalPage
  lang="en"
  routeKey="privacy"
  title="Privacy policy | FightFlow"
  heading="Privacy"
  eyebrow="Legal"
  description="Privacy policy of the martial arts club FightFlow Wien – ASKÖ: which data we process and what your rights are."
>
  <p>
    We take the protection of your personal data seriously and process it only in accordance with the law (GDPR and the
    Austrian Data Protection Act). The <a href={route('privacy', 'de')} hreflang="de" lang="de">German version</a> is
    legally binding.
  </p>

  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>
    {club.legalName}<br />
    {club.address.street ?? <span class="todo">[club address]</span>}, {club.address.postalCode} Vienna<br />
    E-mail: <a href={`mailto:${club.email}`}>{club.email}</a> · Phone: <a href={club.phoneHref}>{club.phone}</a>
  </p>

  <h2>No cookies, no tracking</h2>
  <p>
    This website sets no cookies, uses no analytics or tracking tools and loads nothing from third parties (fonts are
    served locally). Visiting the site therefore transmits no data to third parties.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting &amp; server logs</h2>
  <p>
    When you visit the website, the hosting provider stores technically necessary information (IP address, date and
    time, requested page, browser and operating system) in server log files to operate the site securely (Art. 6(1)(f)
    GDPR). The logs are deleted automatically after a short period. Hosting provider: <span class="todo"
      >[hosting provider]</span
    >.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact by e-mail or phone</h2>
  <p>
    If you contact us, we process your details to answer your request (Art. 6(1)(b) and (f) GDPR). Our mailbox is
    operated by Google (Gmail), provided by Google Ireland Limited, Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Ireland.
  </p>

  <h2>Online registration</h2>
  <p>
    Through the registration form we process your name, e-mail address, optionally your phone number, the chosen
    membership, start month and optionally your experience and a message. We use this data to handle your registration,
    manage memberships and collect the membership fee. The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR (pre-contractual measures
    and contract performance) and your consent (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR), which you can withdraw at any time.
  </p>
  {
    formEndpoint ? (
      <p>
        Registration data is processed and stored using Google Workspace (Google Apps Script and Google Sheets) of Google
        Ireland Limited. A transfer to the USA cannot be ruled out; Google LLC is certified under the EU-US Data Privacy
        Framework.
      </p>
    ) : (
      <p>
        When you send the form, your e-mail app opens and the registration is sent to our mailbox as an e-mail. The privacy
        policy of your e-mail provider applies in addition.
      </p>
    )
  }

  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>
    We keep your data only as long as necessary for these purposes or for the duration of your membership. Payment
    records are kept for the statutory retention period (§ 132 BAO, seven years).
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Access to your data (Art. 15 GDPR)</li>
    <li>Rectification (Art. 16 GDPR) and erasure (Art. 17 GDPR)</li>
    <li>Restriction of processing (Art. 18 GDPR)</li>
    <li>Data portability (Art. 20 GDPR)</li>
    <li>Objection to processing (Art. 21 GDPR)</li>
    <li>Withdrawal of consent with effect for the future (Art. 7(3) GDPR)</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Just write to <a href={`mailto:${club.email}`}>{club.email}</a>. If you believe the processing of your data
    violates data protection law, you can lodge a complaint with the Austrian Data Protection Authority (Barichgasse
    40–42, 1030 Vienna, <a href="https://www.dsb.gv.at" rel="noopener">www.dsb.gv.at</a>).
  </p>

  <p><em>Last updated: October 2026</em></p>
</LegalPage>
